---
// Testimonials.astro - Sticky note style testimonials
---

<section class="testimonials relative py-32 px-6 overflow-hidden" id="testimonials">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20" data-animate>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-ink-dark mb-4">
        Kind <span class="font-sketch text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-pencil">words</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Testimonials grid - scattered sticky notes -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="sticky-note" data-animate>
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-ink-light mb-4 opacity-40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179zm10 0C13.553 16.227 13 15 13 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179z"/>
        </svg>
        <p class="font-sketch text-xl mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          "Finally, a website that actually feels like us. Fast, beautiful, and we didn't have to lift a finger."
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink-light text-sm">— Sarah K., Small Business Owner</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="sticky-note lg:mt-12" data-animate>
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-ink-light mb-4 opacity-40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179zm10 0C13.553 16.227 13 15 13 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179z"/>
        </svg>
        <p class="font-sketch text-xl mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          "The subscription model is genius. I get updates whenever I need them and don't have to worry about hosting."
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink-light text-sm">— Marcus T., Freelance Consultant</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="sticky-note" data-animate>
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-ink-light mb-4 opacity-40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179zm10 0C13.553 16.227 13 15 13 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179z"/>
        </svg>
        <p class="font-sketch text-xl mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          "Our site loads in under a second. Our bounce rate dropped 40%. Worth every penny."
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink-light text-sm">— Alex R., E-commerce Founder</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
    
    <!-- Decorative elements -->
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 opacity-20 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block">
      <svg class="w-32 h-32 text-pencil" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-20 right-10 opacity-20 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block">
      <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-eraser" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
        <path d="M20 50 Q50 20 80 50 T140 50" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
